# Run queue: waiting, running, paused and finished work
error-db-unavailable = ordin can't reach its saved information right now. Try again in a moment.
error-rrec-end-kind-mismatch = ordin's record of how that work ended doesn't fit its state. Try again.
error-rrec-interrupted-restart = That work was interrupted and can't be started again. Start it afresh.
error-rrec-lease-mismatch = ordin's record of which computer is running that work doesn't fit its state. Try again.
error-rrec-message-invalid = A message must be 1 to 262,144 characters. Change the message.
error-run-bad-input = ordin couldn't act on that. Check what you entered and try again.
error-run-duplicate-id = That work has already been started.
error-run-lease-lost = That work was taken over by another ordin window, so this change wasn't made. Try again.
error-run-limit = The work stopped because it reached a limit.
error-run-not-cancellable = That work has already finished or can't be found, so it can't be cancelled.
error-run-not-paused = That work isn't paused or can't be found, so it can't be resumed.
error-run-session-record-too-large = The work has grown too large to pause. Finish it or start afresh.
error-run-thread-busy = That conversation already has work waiting or running. Wait for it to finish.
error-run-thread-not-found = That conversation can't be found.
